<title>SWEDEN: Swedish bond auction oversubscribed.</title>
<headline>Swedish bond auction oversubscribed.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average accepted yield at an auction of two billion crowns of nine-year bonds was 6.83 percent, Sweden's National Debt Office said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Loan 1038</p>
<p>    Volume issued(millions)		1,999</p>
<p>    Total bids    (millions)	     4,793</p>
<p>    Number of accepted bids		   31</p>
<p>    Number of bids				54</p>
<p>    Lowest yields			     6.82 pct</p>
<p>    Highest yields			    6.84 pct</p>
<p>    Weighted average yield		  6.83 pct</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700</p>
</text>
